@title 3D: heat and EMC switch off from the toolbar and stay off, one switch each
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The 3D toolbar's Heat and EMC are the only switches of those views: Heat off takes the strip and both panels with it, EMC off takes its panel and legend, and neither comes back by itself (docs/design/3d-panels-audit.md).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
shot 3d-start
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
expect "fills this strip"
expect "Vents and fans"
shot heat-on
click_text "✔ Heat"
wait 20
expect_not "fills this strip"
expect_not "Vents and fans"
shot heat-off
click_text EMC #1
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
shot emc-on
click_text "✔ EMC"
wait 30
expect_not "Indicative model"
shot emc-off
wait 30
expect_not "Indicative model"
check_layout
click_text Layers #1
wait 20
shot layers
